WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.450
My name is Muhammad Sakhawat. I have spent my life among institutions, countries and languages.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:18.300
In uniform, I learned that a message only matters when it arrives.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:27.500
Running work by hand, I saw good work lost, because no one could show who agreed to what.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:36.070
Among people far from home, I saw what it means to be heard in your own language.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:39.820
And through all of it, I wrote.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:47.570
Today, software can write the email, answer the question, and draft the chapter.

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:53.120
So we built three products around one answer.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:01:03.290
Orchestrate finds the customer and follows through, and the owner says yes.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:18.940
Aura is where people speak in their own language, and the places in their lives answer in their own name.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:27.240
Colophon keeps every edition of a work with the person who wrote it.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:34.990
Let the machine do the work. Keep the person who owns it in charge of it.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.290
That is Aura Platform.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:41.640
I would be glad to hear from you.
